	(text_box "PAM8013AKR\n\nSynopsis:\n\n	3W MONO CLASS D AUDIO AMPLIFIER\n\nDatasheet:\n\n	https://www.diodes.com/datasheet/download/PAM8013.pdf\n\nVoltage:\n\n	Supply Voltage from 2.8V to 5.5 V.\n\nSD:\n\n	Shutdown control pin. Should not be left disconnected.\n\nShutdown current: \n	<1 uA\n"
